              "Reviewed all 17 changed paths. Claude launch now builds its stdin from the embedded preamble, the schema, a blank line and the brief. The tests assert the exact stdin bytes, the single schema occurrence, the removed {schema} slot, the absence of a trailing newline, and that claude starts with no deployed agent file.",
